          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted max-w-[480px] mx-auto leading-[1.6] mb-6">OKAD manages UGC creator networks and produces content campaigns for brands worldwide. Whether you are a creator looking for guidance or a brand seeking high-performing UGC &mdash; let's talk.</p>
